OL,3,GNEWSAMy autistic son could be trapped
OL,4,Ain the house if we lose our disabled
OL,5,Aparking bay
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe dedicated disabled parking bay,
OL,8,Fdirectly outside the family's home and
OL,9,Fonly to be used by them, was given as
OL,10,Fpart of a Pembrokeshire council pilot
OL,11,Fscheme in 2022. The council says the
OL,12,Ffuture of the scheme will be decided in
OL,13,Fdue course.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
